fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analyticsoverlay/objectdetectionoverlay.html#objectdetectionoverlay:tracking-outline-colors","fragment":"\n\ttracking-outline-colors\n\nIn the presence of tracking information, each object will get its\nown color, ignores object-detection-outline-color\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\ttrue\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});